{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2013/02/15/8928386/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"前回の似顔絵の答えは、設楽さんでしたー＼( ^o^ )／"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさん有難う！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お早う御座います ○△"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2013/02/15/8928386/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちょっと眠たい...  （笑）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今ね、すっごく幸せなんです○°"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんでかってね、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"チョコレート沢山食べれたからです( *´ω`* )♡ほんわ～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日みんながチョコ沢山くれて、嬉しかったですﾃﾍﾘﾝ( ^o^ )有難う"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"去年は、デビュー直前で忙しくてバレンタインに何もしてあげられなかったから、今年は、メンバーのために\n頑張って手作りしました (#^.^#)きゅん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつも有難うって、こんなときじゃないと、恥ずかしくて中々、伝えられないから... ＾＾///\n早起きして、トリュフとフォンダンショコラ作りました ＊"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんか、バレンタインって、みんなの笑顔がみれて素敵だなーって思いました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やっぱり、乃木坂だいすきです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もちろん、みなさんのことも大好きです♪\nチョコは渡せないけど、いつも有難う御座います＾＾◎"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そんな気持ちをカラダで表現してみるとこうなる。キラッ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2013/02/15/%E3%81%84%E3%81%AE%E3%81%86%E3%81%881.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どっちがさゆか、わかるかな？☆ミ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2013/02/15/8928386/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、お知らせです＊＊"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"２月２８日発売のBUBKAさんに\nソロで載らせて頂きます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぜひ、みてくだーさゆにゃん＼( ^o^ )／"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"では、学校・お仕事がんばります！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"同じく学校の方や、お仕事の方も、\n一緒に頑張りましょうね (o^^o)◎"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさんにとって、素敵な\n一日になりますように。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さゆにゃん"}],"source":"archive"}